<title>SPAIN: Spanish brokers Q1 pre-tax profits up 122 pct.</title>
<headline>Spanish brokers Q1 pre-tax profits up 122 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pre-tax profits of Spanish financial intermediaries who are members of the Madrid Bourse rose 121.9 percent in the first quarter of the year to 13.95 billion pesetas compared with the year-ago period, data compiled by the Bourse showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Following is a list of all companies with Q1 pre-tax profit versus the Q1 1996 (in millions of pesetas).</p>
